	(text "80291 SIMULATION VALUES - calculated/estimated, NOT Ten-Tec data\nManual PDF p.41 / printed p.3-25. -I labels = mixer side (input, manual right-hand pins);\n-O labels = 80285 driver side (output). Unit A = input winding, unit B = output winding.\nT91-1 (T1) 7.25 MHz: 5.60 uH per winding, C91-5/6 82 pF\nT91-2 (T2) 14.25 MHz: 2.08 uH per winding, C91-7/8 56 pF\nT91-3 (T3) 21.25 MHz: 2.16 uH per winding, C91-9/10 22 pF\nT91-4 (T4) 29.0 MHz: 2.15 uH per winding, C91-11/12 10 pF\nL resonates documented C + 4 pF stray at band centre (calculated).\nTaps, Qu=100 and K=0.08 between windings are estimates for\n50 ohm tap terminations: loaded Q 18.75, kQ = 1.5 (overcoupled).\nL91-1, L91-2 2.7 uH: fitted to documented C91-2/3/4 for a flat\n3.5-4.0 MHz passband, 47 ohm terminations (estimated, 2.4-3.1 uH).\nModel: spice/models/80291_bandpass_magnetics.lib"
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 20.32 152.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
